{"Direct assignment from params[:embeddable_host][:host] without sanitization - before_validation callback with sub! can raise if host is nil": 0.9125385284423828, "If params[:id] references a non-existent record, host will be nil and calling save_host(host) will raise NoMethodError on host.host assignment": 0.9158080816268921, "Case-sensitive host comparison: where(\"lower(host) = ?\", host) compares lowercase column to raw uri.host value, causing match failures if uri.host contains uppercase characters": 0.9213097095489502, "Migration query will raise exception if no rows are returned - execute()[0]['id'] will fail with NoMethodError when embed_category setting was never set or category was deleted": 0.9805189371109009, "EmbeddableHost.first returns nil if no record found, causing host.destroy to fail with NoMethodError: undefined method 'destroy' for nil:NilClass": 0.944589376449585, "In *_ids handling, obj[k].map assumes obj[k] is always an array - will throw if server returns null or scalar for empty *_ids fields": 0.7692776322364807, "The update action fetches @embedding but never processes parameters or performs any update operation - action does nothing": 0.5768607258796692, "If destroyRecord() fails (network error, server error), the host remains in UI but user thinks it was deleted - error is silently swallowed": 0.7145845293998718}